Looking at this problem, I need to find (Σ_{a∈A} cos(aπ/p))² + (Σ_{b∈B} cos(bπ/p))² where A and B partition the odd numbers {1,3,...,p-2} into quadratic residues and non-residues mod p, with p = 4n+1 prime.

